# Nothing in here is required to run the app locally, and you should not paste
# these keys into Vercel by hand. An empty value is worse than a missing one:
# the code treats a defined-but-empty var as "configured" being false, and Vercel
# will not overwrite a variable you created yourself.

# Share links need a Blob store. On Vercel, create one under Storage and connect
# it to the project: it injects BLOB_STORE_ID and authenticates over OIDC, so
# there is no token to copy. Only set this if you are running blob uploads
# somewhere other than Vercel.
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=

# Only for a custom domain. Vercel fills the URL in on its own otherwise.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
